      },
      "engagement": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "18104812532638345",
      "text": "Sholawat itu aku baru nyadar — ga perlu nunggu momen khusus buat bacanya.\nTadi pagi, nyuci piring, kepala rame sendiri. ",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeRFZyhG93N",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-09T08:31:22+0000",
